q q 1 0 0 1 48 772.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 21 TL/F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Abstract)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 48 689.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 64.8 Tm[-4780]TJ ( is a Python-based artificial intelligence and machine-learning prototype designed to support)Tj T* (responsible waste segregation and recycling decisions. It accepts an everyday waste description, predicts a)Tj T* (waste category using TF-IDF text features and Logistic Regression, and retrieves structured guidance and)Tj T* (sustainability tips from a prototype dataset. An optional Gemini generative-AI layer can provide conversational)Tj T* (guidance.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 48 637.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 34.8 Tm (The project is primarily aligned with SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production. It demonstrates AI as)Tj T* (a practical decision-support tool while explicitly considering fairness, transparency, ethics, privacy, safety, and)Tj T* (local variation in waste-management rules.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 48 603.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 21 TL/F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (1. Introduction)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 48 550.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 34.8 Tm (Waste segregation is an everyday sustainability challenge. People encounter plastic packaging, food scraps,)Tj T* (paper, glass, metals, batteries, electronics, textiles and other materials, and these items can require different)Tj T* (handling. Uncertainty about classification can make responsible disposal difficult.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 48 513.8898 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 15 TL/F1 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 19.8 Tm[-4780]TJ <2070726f766964657320612073696d706c6520696e74657266616365207768657265206120757365722063616e207479706520616e206974656d207375636820617320936f6c64206d6f62696c652070686f6e65942c209362616e616e61>Tj T* <7065656c94206f722093706c617374696320626f74746c659420616e64207265636569766520612063617465676f72792c206d6174657269616c20696e666f726d6174696f6e2c20646973706f73616c2067756964616e636520616e6420616e2065636f207469702e>Tj T* E